{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uhuq97WYcyzp7racEdaFWx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 design space characterization framing 完全成立，且新增 downstream\n2\t  utility section 作为第四贡献。Claims: (1) formulation equivalence at func-level, (2) complexity-dependent\n3\t  divergence is model-contingent (Qwen CWM collapse vs DeepSeek CWM functional), (3)\n4\t  diagnostic granularity at no accuracy cost, (4) diagnostic info enables targeted\n5\t  re-repair (+10-15pp resolve rate). 论文从 empirical characterization 升级为 characterization\n6\t  + actionable downstream benefit。EMNLP Main 有力投稿。'\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: deepseek-cls-repo-v4\n9\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n10\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B LoRA classification on SWE-bench repo-level\n11\t    data, seed 42, max_seq_len=8192\n12\t  expected_results:\n13\t    test_accuracy: 82.3\n14\t    f1_macro: 78.5\n15\t    f1_fail: 70.2\n16\t    f1_pass: 86.8\n17\t    precision_fail: 75.4\n18\t    recall_fail: 65.7\n19\t    precision_pass: 84.9\n20\t    recall_pass: 88.8\n21\t    unparseable_pct: 1.2\n22\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n23\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 9.34\n24\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n25\t    total_samples: 9784\n26\t  result_rationale: DeepSeek 在 func-level CLS 达到 86.9%，repo-level 由于上下文更长、代码更复杂，预期下降约\n27\t    4-5pp。Qwen3-4B repo CLS 在 ckpt-4600 test 上达到 83.63%，DeepSeek-8B 应在类似水平或略低（因为 DeepSeek\n28\t    LoRA 在 func-level 并未超过 Qwen CLS 太多）。DeepSeek tokenizer 产生的 unparseable 极低（func-level\n29\t    为 0），repo-level 也应保持 <2%。\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS (seed 42) — Accuracy 82.3%, F1_macro 78.5%, gap\n32\t    vs majority +9.3pp'\n33\t  figures_description:\n34\t  - Confusion matrix showing balanced precision/recall tradeoff, no severe bias toward\n35\t    pass or fail\n36\t  analysis: DeepSeek CLS repo-level 表现与 Qwen CLS 8B (84.8% best ckpt) 相当，略低 2-3pp\n37\t    可能因为 DeepSeek base model 对 Python 代码的 pre-training distribution 不同。关键是 unparseable\n38\t    保持极低，确认 CLS formulation 在两个 model family 上都 robust。\n39\t- name: deepseek-cls-repo-s123\n40\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n41\t  description: DeepSeek repo-level CLS seed 123 replication\n42\t  expected_results:\n43\t    test_accuracy: 80.8\n44\t    f1_macro: 76.9\n45\t    f1_fail: 68.1\n46\t    f1_pass: 85.7\n47\t    unparseable_pct: 1.0\n48\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n49\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 7.84\n50\t  result_rationale: Seed variance 在 repo-level 约 ±1.5pp（参考 Qwen 4B ckpt 间差异）。Seed\n51\t    123 可能略低于 seed 42，但仍显著高于 majority baseline。两个 seed 均值约 81.5% 确认 DeepSeek CLS repo-level\n52\t    的可靠性。\n53\t  tables:\n54\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CLS multi-seed — mean 81.6 ± 1.1%'\n55\t  figures_description: []\n56\t  analysis: 两个 seed 结果一致性好（差异 <2pp），支持 CLS formulation 在 DeepSeek repo-level 的稳定性。\n57\t- name: deepseek-cwm-repo\n58\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n59\t  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation, seed 42, max_new_tokens=1024, max_seq_len=8192\n60\t  expected_results:\n61\t    test_accuracy: 78.5\n62\t    f1_macro: 72.3\n63\t    f1_fail: 60.8\n64\t    f1_pass: 83.8\n65\t    unparseable_pct: 11.8\n66\t    exact_match_rate: 52.3\n67\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n68\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.54\n69\t    gen_length_mean: 280\n70\t    gen_length_median: 195\n71\t  result_rationale: DeepSeek func-level CWM 0% unparseable，但 repo-level 输出更复杂（多测试结果、长\n72\t    traceback），预期 unparseable 升至 10-15%。这远低于 Qwen 的 53-93%，证实 CWM failure 是 tokenizer-specific。Accuracy\n73\t    因 unparseable 被判 fail 而下降，但 parseable subset 准确率应接近 func-level 的 85-87%。CLS-CWM\n74\t    gap 约 3-4pp，在 best tier 定义的 [-2, 10] 范围内。\n75\t  tables:\n76\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM — Accuracy 78.5%, Unparseable 11.8% (vs Qwen 53-93%)'\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - 'Bar chart: CWM unparseable rate by model family — Qwen 54-93% vs DeepSeek 11.8%,\n79\t    demonstrating tokenizer-specific failure'\n80\t  analysis: 核心发现：DeepSeek CWM 在 repo-level 的 unparseable 从 Qwen 的灾难性 53-93% 降至 11.8%，直接证明\n81\t    CWM failure 是 tokenizer/model-specific 而非 formulation-inherent。CLS 仍有 3-4pp 优势但差距大幅缩小，支持\n82\t    Path B narrative：formulation advantage is model-contingent。\n83\t- name: deepseek-cwm-repo-s123\n84\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n85\t  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation seed 123 replication\n86\t  expected_results:\n87\t    test_accuracy: 76.9\n88\t    f1_macro: 70.5\n89\t    f1_fail: 58.3\n90\t    f1_pass: 82.7\n91\t    unparseable_pct: 14.2\n92\t    majority_baseline: 72.96\n93\t    gap_vs_majority_pp: 3.94\n94\t  result_rationale: Seed 123 CWM 可能 unparseable 略高（generation 的随机性更大），但仍保持 <20%。Accuracy\n95\t    因 unparseable 上升而略降。两 seed 均值 unparseable 约 13%，远低于 Qwen 的 50%+ baseline。\n96\t  tables:\n97\t  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM multi-seed — mean accuracy 77.7 ± 1.1%, mean unparseable\n98\t    13.0 ± 1.7%'\n99\t  figures_description: []\n100\t  analysis: CWM 的 seed variance 略大于 CLS（generation 的 stochastic nature），但核心结论不变：DeepSeek\n101\t    CWM functional at repo-level。\n102\t- name: re-repair-phase1-instruct\n103\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n104\t  description: 'Re-repair with Qwen3-8B-Instruct on 60 SWE-bench Verified instances.\n105\t    5 conditions: A1 (minimal control), A2 (test-names-only), B (CLS-diagnostic predictions),\n106\t    C (oracle ground-truth diagnostic), D (random diagnostic). Docker-based resolve\n107\t    rate. pass@1 and pass@5 (temperature=0.7). Paired design across conditions.'\n108\t  expected_results:\n109\t    n_instances: 60\n110\t    samples_per_condition: 5\n111\t    A1_control_resolve_rate: 0.183\n112\t    A2_test_names_resolve_rate: 0.217\n113\t    B_cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.317\n114\t    C_oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.4\n115\t    D_random_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.15\n116\t    B_vs_A1_delta_pp: 13.3\n117\t    B_vs_A2_delta_pp: 10.0\n118\t    C_vs_B_delta_pp: 8.3\n119\t    C_vs_A1_delta_pp: 21.7\n120\t    D_vs_A1_delta_pp: -3.3\n121\t    A1_pass5_resolve_rate: 0.283\n122\t    B_pass5_resolve_rate: 0.433\n123\t    C_pass5_resolve_rate: 0.533\n124\t    B_vs_A1_mcnemar_p: 0.031\n125\t    C_vs_A1_mcnemar_p: 0.004\n126\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n127\t  result_rationale: 'Best tier 要求 B vs A1 delta 在 [10, 18]pp 范围内，oracle vs CLS delta\n128\t    在 [5, 12]pp。\n129\t\n130\t\n131\t    A1 (minimal control, ~18%): SWE-bench Verified 上 8B instruct 模型的 baseline resolve\n132\t    rate 大约在 15-22%（参考 SWE-agent + GPT-4 约 12%，但这里是 simpler prompt + smaller subset\n133\t    of easier instances）。\n134\t\n135\t\n136\t    A2 (test names, ~22%): 仅知道哪些 test 存在但不知道 pass/fail 状态，提供 minor structural guidance，提升\n137\t    3-4pp。\n138\t\n139\t\n140\t    B (CLS diagnostic, ~32%): 模型预测的 per-test pass/fail 信息让 repair agent 能 focus on\n141\t    specific failures。即使预测有 ~12% error rate，fail_recall 93.6% 意味着绝大多数真实 failure 被正确标出。Agent\n142\t    可以 target specific failing tests 而非盲目搜索。13pp 提升合理因为：(1) 搜索空间大幅缩小, (2) agent 可写\n143\t    targeted fix 而非 shotgun approach, (3) 即使部分 FP/FN 存在，overall signal quality 足够\n144\t    actionable。\n145\t\n146\t\n147\t    C (oracle, ~40%): Ground-truth per-test info 消除了 verifier 的 prediction noise。额外\n148\t    8pp 提升来自：消除 FP（不再 fix 不需要 fix 的 test）和 FN（不遗漏真实 failures）。C-B gap 反映 verifier\n149\t    预测质量的 ceiling。\n150\t\n151\t\n152\t    D (random, ~15%): 随机 per-test labels 反而 mislead agent，比 no-info 还差 3pp。确认 diagnostic\n153\t    info 的价值来自 signal quality 而非 mere presence of structured info。\n154\t\n155\t\n156\t    梯度 D < A1 < A2 < B < C 清晰成立，McNemar test p < 0.05 for B vs A1 on n=60。\n157\t\n158\t    '\n159\t  tables:\n160\t  - 'Table: Re-Repair Resolve Rates (pass@1, n=60)\n161\t\n162\t    Condition | Resolve Rate | Δ vs A1 | p-value\n163\t\n164\t    D (random diag) | 15.0% | -3.3pp | 0.62\n165\t\n166\t    A1 (no info) | 18.3% | — | —\n167\t\n168\t    A2 (test names) | 21.7% | +3.3pp | 0.41\n169\t\n170\t    B (CLS diag) | 31.7% | +13.3pp | 0.031*\n171\t\n172\t    C (oracle diag) | 40.0% | +21.7pp | 0.004**\n173\t\n174\t    '\n175\t  - 'Table: Re-Repair pass@5 Comparison\n176\t\n177\t    A1: 28.3% → B: 43.3% → C: 53.3%\n178\t\n179\t    CLS-diagnostic nearly halves the gap between no-info and oracle\n180\t\n181\t    '\n182\t  figures_description:\n183\t  - 'Bar chart with 95% CI error bars: resolve rate by condition. Clear monotonic\n184\t    gradient D < A1 < A2 < B < C.'\n185\t  - 'Paired instance analysis: heatmap showing which instances flip from unresolved→resolved\n186\t    with diagnostic info. Concentration in multi-test-failure instances.'\n187\t  analysis: 'Re-repair 结果强力支持 downstream utility claim。核心 insight：\n188\t\n189\t    1. CLS diagnostic info 即使有 ~12% error rate 仍提供 +13pp resolve rate 提升\n190\t\n191\t    2. 提升集中在 multi-test-failure instances（与 oracle-f2p-stratified 结果一致：T2+ instances\n192\t    贡献 >80% of improvement）\n193\t\n194\t    3. 清晰梯度证明 diagnostic quality matters（random hurts, noisy-but-real helps, perfect\n195\t    helps most）\n196\t\n197\t    4. Oracle-CLS gap (8pp) 量化了 verifier 改进的剩余空间，motivating future work\n198\t\n199\t\n200\t    这直接回应 reviewer concern \"no downstream utility\"：per-test diagnostic 不仅在 accuracy\n201\t    上 equivalent to trajectory-level，还 enables a concrete downstream application。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t- name: swebench-pertest-data\n205\t  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n206\t  description: Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches to extract per-test\n207\t    ground-truth labels. 500 instances × 16 candidates.\n208\t  expected_results:\n209\t    total_instances: 500\n210\t    candidates_per_instance: 16\n211\t    total_evaluations: 8000\n212\t    successful_docker_runs: 7680\n213\t    docker_failure_rate: 0.04\n214\t    mean_tests_per_instance: 12.3\n215\t    median_tests_per_instance: 8\n216\t    f2p_distribution:\n217\t      T1_pct: 45.2\n218\t      T2_pct: 22.8\n219\t      T3_5_pct: 18.6\n220\t      T6plus_pct: 13.4\n221\t    mean_resolve_rate_across_candidates: 0.31\n222\t    total_per_test_labels: 94720\n223\t    wall_time_hours: 18\n224\t    parallelism: 16\n225\t  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench Verified 有 500 个 curated instances。每个 instance 跑 16\n226\t    个 repair candidate（来自不同 repair agent/model 的 patches）。Docker evaluation 的 failure\n227\t    rate 约 4%（timeout, dependency issues）。\n228\t\n229\t\n230\t    F2P test distribution 比 func-level dataset 更丰富（mean 12.3 vs func-level 的 2.3），因为\n231\t    repo-level tests 涵盖更多 edge cases。T6+ 占 13.4% 意味着 per-test granularity 的优势在 repo-level\n232\t    更大。\n233\t\n234\t\n235\t    这个 dataset 是 resource contribution：first large-scale per-test labeled dataset\n236\t    for SWE-bench。支撑 repo-level training 和 re-repair evaluation。\n237\t\n238\t    '\n239\t  tables:\n240\t  - 'Table: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\n241\t\n242\t    Instances: 500 | Candidates/instance: 16 | Total evaluations: 8000\n243\t\n244\t    Successful runs: 7680 (96%) | Total per-test labels: 94,720\n245\t\n246\t    Mean tests/instance: 12.3 | Median: 8\n247\t\n248\t    '\n249\t  figures_description:\n250\t  - Histogram of tests-per-instance distribution, showing long tail (some instances\n251\t    with 50+ tests)\n252\t  analysis: Dataset 构建成功，为 repo-level experiments 和 re-repair evaluation 提供基础。F2P\n253\t    distribution 比 func-level 更重 tail（T6+ 13.4% vs 5.1%），预示 per-test advantage 在 repo-level\n254\t    更显著。\n255\t- name: diagnostic-rerepair-pilot\n256\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n257\t  description: 'Original planned experiment: repair agent with per-test failure predictions\n258\t    vs no info on 200 instances. Superseded by re-repair-phase1-instruct design but\n259\t    kept for completeness.'\n260\t  expected_results:\n261\t    n_instances: 200\n262\t    control_resolve_rate: 0.19\n263\t    cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.33\n264\t    delta_pp: 14.0\n265\t    paired_t_p_value: 0.008\n266\t    effect_size_cohens_d: 0.42\n267\t  result_rationale: 在 200 instances 上 paired design 给出更强 statistical power。Delta 14pp\n268\t    在 best tier [10,18] 范围内。Larger n 使得 p < 0.01 成为可能。Effect size medium (d=0.42)\n269\t    反映 diagnostic info 是 useful-but-not-transformative intervention。\n270\t  tables: []\n271\t  figures_description: []\n272\t  analysis: Larger sample 版本确认 re-repair-phase1-instruct 的发现，提供更强 statistical evidence。\n273\t- name: deepseek-repo-composite-analysis\n274\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n275\t  description: 'Cross-model repo-level comparison: Qwen vs DeepSeek × CLS vs CWM.\n276\t    Design space characterization 的核心 table。'\n277\t  expected_results:\n278\t    qwen4b_cls_accuracy: 83.63\n279\t    qwen4b_cwm_accuracy: 58.04\n280\t    qwen4b_cwm_unparseable_pct: 53.7\n281\t    qwen4b_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 25.59\n282\t    qwen8b_cls_accuracy: 84.79\n283\t    qwen8b_cwm_unparseable_pct: 93.0\n284\t    deepseek_cls_accuracy: 81.6\n285\t    deepseek_cwm_accuracy: 77.7\n286\t    deepseek_cwm_unparseable_pct: 13.0\n287\t    deepseek_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 3.9\n288\t    deepseek_func_cls_accuracy: 86.85\n289\t    deepseek_func_cwm_accuracy: 86.83\n290\t    deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 0.02\n291\t    qwen_func_cls_accuracy: 88.41\n292\t    qwen_func_cwm_accuracy: 87.19\n293\t    qwen_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 1.22\n294\t    deepseek_traj_repo_accuracy: 77.1\n295\t    qwen_traj_repo_accuracy: 85.66\n296\t  result_rationale: 'Design space characterization 的核心 evidence：\n297\t\n298\t\n299\t    Function-level: CLS ≈ CWM 在两个 model family 上都成立（gap < 1.5pp，TOST equivalence confirmed）。证明\n300\t    formulation choice at low complexity 不重要。\n301\t\n302\t\n303\t    Repo-level divergence pattern:\n304\t\n305\t    - Qwen: CLS >> CWM (25pp gap)，因为 CWM unparseable 53-93%。Tokenizer 无法 handle structured\n306\t    multi-test output。\n307\t\n308\t    - DeepSeek: CLS > CWM (4pp gap)，CWM unparseable 仅 13%。Tokenizer 支持 structured\n309\t    generation。\n310\t\n311\t\n312\t    这是 Path B narrative：formulation advantage magnitude is model-contingent。CLS 仍有\n313\t    consistent（小）优势，但 CWM 在合适的 tokenizer 下 functional。\n314\t\n315\t\n316\t    关键 insight：Qwen 的 CWM \"failure\" 不是因为 generation-based verification 不可行，而是因为其 tokenizer\n317\t    在长结构化输出时 degenerate。DeepSeek 证明这不是 formulation-inherent limitation。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t  tables:\n321\t  - \"Table: Design Space — Accuracy by Formulation × Model × Complexity\\n        \\\n322\t    \\    | Function-Level      | Repo-Level\\nModel       | CLS   | CWM  | Gap  | CLS\\\n323\t    \\   | CWM   | Gap   | CWM Unparse\\nQwen3-4B    | 88.4  | 87.2 | +1.2 | 83.6  |\\\n324\t    \\ 58.0  | +25.6 | 53.7%\\nQwen3-8B    | 90.5  | 87.7 | +2.8 | 84.8  | —     | —\\\n325\t    \\     | 93.0%\\nDeepSeek-8B | 86.9  | 86.8 | +0.0 | 81.6  | 77.7  | +3.9  | 13.0%\\n\"\n326\t  - 'Table: Formulation Robustness Summary\n327\t\n328\t    Formulation | Func-Level (2 models) | Repo-Level (2 models)\n329\t\n330\t    CLS         | 86.9–90.5 (robust)    | 81.6–84.8 (robust)\n331\t\n332\t    CWM         | 86.8–87.7 (robust)    | 58.0–77.7 (fragile, model-dependent)\n333\t\n334\t    TRAJ        | 85.7–86.2             | 77.1–85.7 (variable)\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t  figures_description:\n338\t  - '2×2 heatmap: rows = model family (Qwen, DeepSeek), cols = complexity (func, repo).\n339\t    Cell color = CLS-CWM gap. Shows divergence only in top-right (Qwen × repo).'\n340\t  - 'Scatter plot: CWM unparseable rate (x) vs CLS-CWM accuracy gap (y). Strong positive\n341\t    correlation. Qwen repo as outlier, DeepSeek repo near origin.'\n342\t  analysis: 'Best tier narrative 完全成立：\n343\t\n344\t    1. Claim 1 (equivalence at func-level): ✓ 两个 model family 均 confirmed\n345\t\n346\t    2. Claim 2 (model-contingent divergence): ✓ DeepSeek CWM functional (13% unparse)\n347\t    vs Qwen CWM collapse (53-93%)\n348\t\n349\t    3. Claim 3 (diagnostic granularity): ✓ CLS per-test matches TRAJ accuracy while\n350\t    enabling re-repair\n351\t\n352\t    4. Claim 4 (downstream utility): ✓ +13pp resolve rate from CLS diagnostic info\n353\t\n354\t\n355\t    EMNLP Main 投稿强度：4 个 clean contributions，controlled comparison methodology，两个 model\n356\t    families 交叉验证，downstream application validated。唯一 limitation 是 repo-level sample\n357\t    size 较小（48 test instances per seed），但 multi-seed replication 部分弥补。'\n358\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44566697-d6b1-448a-9c2e-758fc9465c03","uuid":"329a686e-eb12-4884-ac19-bb4fb992ad33","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:00:45.983Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T034206/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 design space characterization framing 完全成立，且新增 downstream\n  utility section 作为第四贡献。Claims: (1) formulation equivalence at func-level, (2) complexity-dependent\n  divergence is model-contingent (Qwen CWM collapse vs DeepSeek CWM functional), (3)\n  diagnostic granularity at no accuracy cost, (4) diagnostic info enables targeted\n  re-repair (+10-15pp resolve rate). 论文从 empirical characterization 升级为 characterization\n  + actionable downstream benefit。EMNLP Main 有力投稿。'\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: deepseek-cls-repo-v4\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B LoRA classification on SWE-bench repo-level\n    data, seed 42, max_seq_len=8192\n  expected_results:\n    test_accuracy: 82.3\n    f1_macro: 78.5\n    f1_fail: 70.2\n    f1_pass: 86.8\n    precision_fail: 75.4\n    recall_fail: 65.7\n    precision_pass: 84.9\n    recall_pass: 88.8\n    unparseable_pct: 1.2\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 9.34\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-600\n    total_samples: 9784\n  result_rationale: DeepSeek 在 func-level CLS 达到 86.9%，repo-level 由于上下文更长、代码更复杂，预期下降约\n    4-5pp。Qwen3-4B repo CLS 在 ckpt-4600 test 上达到 83.63%，DeepSeek-8B 应在类似水平或略低（因为 DeepSeek\n    LoRA 在 func-level 并未超过 Qwen CLS 太多）。DeepSeek tokenizer 产生的 unparseable 极低（func-level\n    为 0），repo-level 也应保持 <2%。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS (seed 42) — Accuracy 82.3%, F1_macro 78.5%, gap\n    vs majority +9.3pp'\n  figures_description:\n  - Confusion matrix showing balanced precision/recall tradeoff, no severe bias toward\n    pass or fail\n  analysis: DeepSeek CLS repo-level 表现与 Qwen CLS 8B (84.8% best ckpt) 相当，略低 2-3pp\n    可能因为 DeepSeek base model 对 Python 代码的 pre-training distribution 不同。关键是 unparseable\n    保持极低，确认 CLS formulation 在两个 model family 上都 robust。\n- name: deepseek-cls-repo-s123\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek repo-level CLS seed 123 replication\n  expected_results:\n    test_accuracy: 80.8\n    f1_macro: 76.9\n    f1_fail: 68.1\n    f1_pass: 85.7\n    unparseable_pct: 1.0\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 7.84\n  result_rationale: Seed variance 在 repo-level 约 ±1.5pp（参考 Qwen 4B ckpt 间差异）。Seed\n    123 可能略低于 seed 42，但仍显著高于 majority baseline。两个 seed 均值约 81.5% 确认 DeepSeek CLS repo-level\n    的可靠性。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CLS multi-seed — mean 81.6 ± 1.1%'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 两个 seed 结果一致性好（差异 <2pp），支持 CLS formulation 在 DeepSeek repo-level 的稳定性。\n- name: deepseek-cwm-repo\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation, seed 42, max_new_tokens=1024, max_seq_len=8192\n  expected_results:\n    test_accuracy: 78.5\n    f1_macro: 72.3\n    f1_fail: 60.8\n    f1_pass: 83.8\n    unparseable_pct: 11.8\n    exact_match_rate: 52.3\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.54\n    gen_length_mean: 280\n    gen_length_median: 195\n  result_rationale: DeepSeek func-level CWM 0% unparseable，但 repo-level 输出更复杂（多测试结果、长\n    traceback），预期 unparseable 升至 10-15%。这远低于 Qwen 的 53-93%，证实 CWM failure 是 tokenizer-specific。Accuracy\n    因 unparseable 被判 fail 而下降，但 parseable subset 准确率应接近 func-level 的 85-87%。CLS-CWM\n    gap 约 3-4pp，在 best tier 定义的 [-2, 10] 范围内。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM — Accuracy 78.5%, Unparseable 11.8% (vs Qwen 53-93%)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: CWM unparseable rate by model family — Qwen 54-93% vs DeepSeek 11.8%,\n    demonstrating tokenizer-specific failure'\n  analysis: 核心发现：DeepSeek CWM 在 repo-level 的 unparseable 从 Qwen 的灾难性 53-93% 降至 11.8%，直接证明\n    CWM failure 是 tokenizer/model-specific 而非 formulation-inherent。CLS 仍有 3-4pp 优势但差距大幅缩小，支持\n    Path B narrative：formulation advantage is model-contingent。\n- name: deepseek-cwm-repo-s123\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: DeepSeek repo-level CWM generation seed 123 replication\n  expected_results:\n    test_accuracy: 76.9\n    f1_macro: 70.5\n    f1_fail: 58.3\n    f1_pass: 82.7\n    unparseable_pct: 14.2\n    majority_baseline: 72.96\n    gap_vs_majority_pp: 3.94\n  result_rationale: Seed 123 CWM 可能 unparseable 略高（generation 的随机性更大），但仍保持 <20%。Accuracy\n    因 unparseable 上升而略降。两 seed 均值 unparseable 约 13%，远低于 Qwen 的 50%+ baseline。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: DeepSeek Repo CWM multi-seed — mean accuracy 77.7 ± 1.1%, mean unparseable\n    13.0 ± 1.7%'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: CWM 的 seed variance 略大于 CLS（generation 的 stochastic nature），但核心结论不变：DeepSeek\n    CWM functional at repo-level。\n- name: re-repair-phase1-instruct\n  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n  description: 'Re-repair with Qwen3-8B-Instruct on 60 SWE-bench Verified instances.\n    5 conditions: A1 (minimal control), A2 (test-names-only), B (CLS-diagnostic predictions),\n    C (oracle ground-truth diagnostic), D (random diagnostic). Docker-based resolve\n    rate. pass@1 and pass@5 (temperature=0.7). Paired design across conditions.'\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 60\n    samples_per_condition: 5\n    A1_control_resolve_rate: 0.183\n    A2_test_names_resolve_rate: 0.217\n    B_cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.317\n    C_oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.4\n    D_random_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.15\n    B_vs_A1_delta_pp: 13.3\n    B_vs_A2_delta_pp: 10.0\n    C_vs_B_delta_pp: 8.3\n    C_vs_A1_delta_pp: 21.7\n    D_vs_A1_delta_pp: -3.3\n    A1_pass5_resolve_rate: 0.283\n    B_pass5_resolve_rate: 0.433\n    C_pass5_resolve_rate: 0.533\n    B_vs_A1_mcnemar_p: 0.031\n    C_vs_A1_mcnemar_p: 0.004\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Best tier 要求 B vs A1 delta 在 [10, 18]pp 范围内，oracle vs CLS delta\n    在 [5, 12]pp。\n\n\n    A1 (minimal control, ~18%): SWE-bench Verified 上 8B instruct 模型的 baseline resolve\n    rate 大约在 15-22%（参考 SWE-agent + GPT-4 约 12%，但这里是 simpler prompt + smaller subset\n    of easier instances）。\n\n\n    A2 (test names, ~22%): 仅知道哪些 test 存在但不知道 pass/fail 状态，提供 minor structural guidance，提升\n    3-4pp。\n\n\n    B (CLS diagnostic, ~32%): 模型预测的 per-test pass/fail 信息让 repair agent 能 focus on\n    specific failures。即使预测有 ~12% error rate，fail_recall 93.6% 意味着绝大多数真实 failure 被正确标出。Agent\n    可以 target specific failing tests 而非盲目搜索。13pp 提升合理因为：(1) 搜索空间大幅缩小, (2) agent 可写\n    targeted fix 而非 shotgun approach, (3) 即使部分 FP/FN 存在，overall signal quality 足够\n    actionable。\n\n\n    C (oracle, ~40%): Ground-truth per-test info 消除了 verifier 的 prediction noise。额外\n    8pp 提升来自：消除 FP（不再 fix 不需要 fix 的 test）和 FN（不遗漏真实 failures）。C-B gap 反映 verifier\n    预测质量的 ceiling。\n\n\n    D (random, ~15%): 随机 per-test labels 反而 mislead agent，比 no-info 还差 3pp。确认 diagnostic\n    info 的价值来自 signal quality 而非 mere presence of structured info。\n\n\n    梯度 D < A1 < A2 < B < C 清晰成立，McNemar test p < 0.05 for B vs A1 on n=60。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Re-Repair Resolve Rates (pass@1, n=60)\n\n    Condition | Resolve Rate | Δ vs A1 | p-value\n\n    D (random diag) | 15.0% | -3.3pp | 0.62\n\n    A1 (no info) | 18.3% | — | —\n\n    A2 (test names) | 21.7% | +3.3pp | 0.41\n\n    B (CLS diag) | 31.7% | +13.3pp | 0.031*\n\n    C (oracle diag) | 40.0% | +21.7pp | 0.004**\n\n    '\n  - 'Table: Re-Repair pass@5 Comparison\n\n    A1: 28.3% → B: 43.3% → C: 53.3%\n\n    CLS-diagnostic nearly halves the gap between no-info and oracle\n\n    '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart with 95% CI error bars: resolve rate by condition. Clear monotonic\n    gradient D < A1 < A2 < B < C.'\n  - 'Paired instance analysis: heatmap showing which instances flip from unresolved→resolved\n    with diagnostic info. Concentration in multi-test-failure instances.'\n  analysis: 'Re-repair 结果强力支持 downstream utility claim。核心 insight：\n\n    1. CLS diagnostic info 即使有 ~12% error rate 仍提供 +13pp resolve rate 提升\n\n    2. 提升集中在 multi-test-failure instances（与 oracle-f2p-stratified 结果一致：T2+ instances\n    贡献 >80% of improvement）\n\n    3. 清晰梯度证明 diagnostic quality matters（random hurts, noisy-but-real helps, perfect\n    helps most）\n\n    4. Oracle-CLS gap (8pp) 量化了 verifier 改进的剩余空间，motivating future work\n\n\n    这直接回应 reviewer concern \"no downstream utility\"：per-test diagnostic 不仅在 accuracy\n    上 equivalent to trajectory-level，还 enables a concrete downstream application。\n\n    '\n- name: swebench-pertest-data\n  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n  description: Docker re-evaluation of SWE-bench Verified patches to extract per-test\n    ground-truth labels. 500 instances × 16 candidates.\n  expected_results:\n    total_instances: 500\n    candidates_per_instance: 16\n    total_evaluations: 8000\n    successful_docker_runs: 7680\n    docker_failure_rate: 0.04\n    mean_tests_per_instance: 12.3\n    median_tests_per_instance: 8\n    f2p_distribution:\n      T1_pct: 45.2\n      T2_pct: 22.8\n      T3_5_pct: 18.6\n      T6plus_pct: 13.4\n    mean_resolve_rate_across_candidates: 0.31\n    total_per_test_labels: 94720\n    wall_time_hours: 18\n    parallelism: 16\n  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench Verified 有 500 个 curated instances。每个 instance 跑 16\n    个 repair candidate（来自不同 repair agent/model 的 patches）。Docker evaluation 的 failure\n    rate 约 4%（timeout, dependency issues）。\n\n\n    F2P test distribution 比 func-level dataset 更丰富（mean 12.3 vs func-level 的 2.3），因为\n    repo-level tests 涵盖更多 edge cases。T6+ 占 13.4% 意味着 per-test granularity 的优势在 repo-level\n    更大。\n\n\n    这个 dataset 是 resource contribution：first large-scale per-test labeled dataset\n    for SWE-bench。支撑 repo-level training 和 re-repair evaluation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\n\n    Instances: 500 | Candidates/instance: 16 | Total evaluations: 8000\n\n    Successful runs: 7680 (96%) | Total per-test labels: 94,720\n\n    Mean tests/instance: 12.3 | Median: 8\n\n    '\n  figures_description:\n  - Histogram of tests-per-instance distribution, showing long tail (some instances\n    with 50+ tests)\n  analysis: Dataset 构建成功，为 repo-level experiments 和 re-repair evaluation 提供基础。F2P\n    distribution 比 func-level 更重 tail（T6+ 13.4% vs 5.1%），预示 per-test advantage 在 repo-level\n    更显著。\n- name: diagnostic-rerepair-pilot\n  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n  description: 'Original planned experiment: repair agent with per-test failure predictions\n    vs no info on 200 instances. Superseded by re-repair-phase1-instruct design but\n    kept for completeness.'\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 200\n    control_resolve_rate: 0.19\n    cls_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 0.33\n    delta_pp: 14.0\n    paired_t_p_value: 0.008\n    effect_size_cohens_d: 0.42\n  result_rationale: 在 200 instances 上 paired design 给出更强 statistical power。Delta 14pp\n    在 best tier [10,18] 范围内。Larger n 使得 p < 0.01 成为可能。Effect size medium (d=0.42)\n    反映 diagnostic info 是 useful-but-not-transformative intervention。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Larger sample 版本确认 re-repair-phase1-instruct 的发现，提供更强 statistical evidence。\n- name: deepseek-repo-composite-analysis\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: 'Cross-model repo-level comparison: Qwen vs DeepSeek × CLS vs CWM.\n    Design space characterization 的核心 table。'\n  expected_results:\n    qwen4b_cls_accuracy: 83.63\n    qwen4b_cwm_accuracy: 58.04\n    qwen4b_cwm_unparseable_pct: 53.7\n    qwen4b_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 25.59\n    qwen8b_cls_accuracy: 84.79\n    qwen8b_cwm_unparseable_pct: 93.0\n    deepseek_cls_accuracy: 81.6\n    deepseek_cwm_accuracy: 77.7\n    deepseek_cwm_unparseable_pct: 13.0\n    deepseek_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 3.9\n    deepseek_func_cls_accuracy: 86.85\n    deepseek_func_cwm_accuracy: 86.83\n    deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 0.02\n    qwen_func_cls_accuracy: 88.41\n    qwen_func_cwm_accuracy: 87.19\n    qwen_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp: 1.22\n    deepseek_traj_repo_accuracy: 77.1\n    qwen_traj_repo_accuracy: 85.66\n  result_rationale: 'Design space characterization 的核心 evidence：\n\n\n    Function-level: CLS ≈ CWM 在两个 model family 上都成立（gap < 1.5pp，TOST equivalence confirmed）。证明\n    formulation choice at low complexity 不重要。\n\n\n    Repo-level divergence pattern:\n\n    - Qwen: CLS >> CWM (25pp gap)，因为 CWM unparseable 53-93%。Tokenizer 无法 handle structured\n    multi-test output。\n\n    - DeepSeek: CLS > CWM (4pp gap)，CWM unparseable 仅 13%。Tokenizer 支持 structured\n    generation。\n\n\n    这是 Path B narrative：formulation advantage magnitude is model-contingent。CLS 仍有\n    consistent（小）优势，但 CWM 在合适的 tokenizer 下 functional。\n\n\n    关键 insight：Qwen 的 CWM \"failure\" 不是因为 generation-based verification 不可行，而是因为其 tokenizer\n    在长结构化输出时 degenerate。DeepSeek 证明这不是 formulation-inherent limitation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - \"Table: Design Space — Accuracy by Formulation × Model × Complexity\\n        \\\n    \\    | Function-Level      | Repo-Level\\nModel       | CLS   | CWM  | Gap  | CLS\\\n    \\   | CWM   | Gap   | CWM Unparse\\nQwen3-4B    | 88.4  | 87.2 | +1.2 | 83.6  |\\\n    \\ 58.0  | +25.6 | 53.7%\\nQwen3-8B    | 90.5  | 87.7 | +2.8 | 84.8  | —     | —\\\n    \\     | 93.0%\\nDeepSeek-8B | 86.9  | 86.8 | +0.0 | 81.6  | 77.7  | +3.9  | 13.0%\\n\"\n  - 'Table: Formulation Robustness Summary\n\n    Formulation | Func-Level (2 models) | Repo-Level (2 models)\n\n    CLS         | 86.9–90.5 (robust)    | 81.6–84.8 (robust)\n\n    CWM         | 86.8–87.7 (robust)    | 58.0–77.7 (fragile, model-dependent)\n\n    TRAJ        | 85.7–86.2             | 77.1–85.7 (variable)\n\n    '\n  figures_description:\n  - '2×2 heatmap: rows = model family (Qwen, DeepSeek), cols = complexity (func, repo).\n    Cell color = CLS-CWM gap. Shows divergence only in top-right (Qwen × repo).'\n  - 'Scatter plot: CWM unparseable rate (x) vs CLS-CWM accuracy gap (y). Strong positive\n    correlation. Qwen repo as outlier, DeepSeek repo near origin.'\n  analysis: 'Best tier narrative 完全成立：\n\n    1. Claim 1 (equivalence at func-level): ✓ 两个 model family 均 confirmed\n\n    2. Claim 2 (model-contingent divergence): ✓ DeepSeek CWM functional (13% unparse)\n    vs Qwen CWM collapse (53-93%)\n\n    3. Claim 3 (diagnostic granularity): ✓ CLS per-test matches TRAJ accuracy while\n    enabling re-repair\n\n    4. Claim 4 (downstream utility): ✓ +13pp resolve rate from CLS diagnostic info\n\n\n    EMNLP Main 投稿强度：4 个 clean contributions，controlled comparison methodology，两个 model\n    families 交叉验证，downstream application validated。唯一 limitation 是 repo-level sample\n    size 较小（48 test instances per seed），但 multi-seed replication 部分弥补。'\n","numLines":358,"startLine":1,"totalLines":358}}}
