ything missing that a top venue would expect (e.g., appendix, error analysis, qualitative examples)?\n\nProvide your output as:\n```\n## R2 Review: Novelty & Related Work\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\n[Bulleted list, 4-6 items]\n\n### Weaknesses\n[Bulleted list, 4-8 items, each with specific detail]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n[3-5 specific questions]\n\n### Related Work Gaps\n[Missing citations or positioning issues]\n\n### Writing Quality Issues\n[Specific examples of problematic writing patterns]\n\n### Score: X/6\n### Confidence: X/5\n```\n","uuid":"d837fa7d-560a-4d11-97bf-f416e2968d35","session_id":"44566697-d6b1-448a-9c2e-758fc9465c03"}
